<title>USA: Siemens unit, EDAP form U.S. partnership.</title>
<headline>Siemens unit, EDAP form U.S. partnership.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens Medical Systems Inc, a unit of Siemens AG, said on Wednesday it formed a partnership with EDAP Technomed in which Siemens will provide nationwide sales support for EDAP's Prostratron microwave treatment for prostate enlargement.</p>
<p>EDAP is a privately held firm based in Lyon, France, with a U.S. subsidiary based in Cambridge, Mass. It makes urological therapy devices.</p>
